{comment: Intro}
| Bb / / / | / / / / | / / / / | / / / / |

{comment: Verse 1}
[Bb]I can’t deny what You’ve done for me
Loosed all my shackles and set me free
Robed me and gave me the victory
I got a [Bb/D]reason, a reason to [Eb]praise
[Bb]I can’t ignore what my eyes have seen
What seemed impossible, I believe
Look at my life, we got history
I got a [Bb/D]reason, a reason to [Eb]praise

